      "description": "Developer on the TPF/CORE Technology Team's Security team where I work on projects related to the passenger security system at Delta. Includes managing SFPD passenger data and the vetting of data/security results between governments and other airlines. Subject matter expert on the passenger documents database and the structured service calls associated PRS8. Work on the mask systems in the VM4 environment, java on the mainframe, and REST API architecture on the mainframe. Work with Corporate Security business partners, including other governments and airline security agencies, as well as other airlines.\n\nWorking to modernize technology at Delta to the Amazon Web Services Cloud. Configuring APIs via the AWS Gateway and lambda functions to understanding the AWS MSK product to publish and consume data via Kafka hosted on the cloud. Understanding how to refactor applications from on premise legacy applications to cloud based architectures applying the Twelve Factor Application Methodology.",
      "insights": "C++, Java and +9 skills"
     },
     {
      "title": "Associate Software Developer",
      "timePeriod": {
       "startDate": {
        "month": 6,
        "year": 2015
       },
