        "month": 10,
        "year": 2018
       }
      },
      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 5 mos",
      "description": "Mainframe programmer who supports the development priorities of the Deltamatic Reservation systems by participating in the development, maintenance, enhancement, and support of applications. One necessity includes understanding business requirements in order to provide the technical design of computer software. Delta uses TPF programming standards and languages such as C++, Assembler/BAL, and SabreTalk. Furthermore, this position includes the troubleshooting and support of computer systems, optimizing performance, resolving problems, and providing timely responses on issues.",
